A","text":"\u003c@UAUFDS92N\u003e\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/15\u003e\n\nWindows で `/C:/Users/...` となる現象ですが、おそらく修正できました（`path.fromFileUrl(...)` を噛ませました）。\n\nなので全体的に整えて Rebase したので、再度動作確認お願いします :bow:\n\nfyi \u003c@UEX9VPSET\u003e","ts":"1619608525.154700","thread_ts":"1619339304.144400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: Add `load()` to source local/remote Vim script by lambdalisue · Pull Request #15 · vim-denops/denops-std-deno","id":1,"title":"Add `load()` to source local/remote Vim script by lambdalisue · Pull Request #15 · vim-denops/denops-std-deno","title_link":"https://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/15","text":"The original version is proposed on #14 by @higashi000","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/15","original_url":"https://github.com/vim-denops/denops-std-deno/pull/15"}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Af=K"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"3a5d9ca6-23ce-41a9-a390-3eab1258b167","type":"message","user":"UAUFDS92N","text":"\u003c@U776661HA\u003e\nWindowsで試してたんですけど`new URL('path', import.meta.url)`でとってこれるpathnameだと\n`/C:/Users/username/hogehoge`って形になってファイルの読み込みができないですね...\nいろいろ試したところ、`C:/Users/username/hogehoge`という形なら使えることを確認しました","ts":"1619339304.144400","thread_ts":"1619339304.144400","reply_count":4,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tjz/"}]}}]
